@startuml UcDeleteExpiredUsers

title Authentication — DeleteExpiredUnverifiedUsersUseCase

skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam activityBorderColor #888888
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam activityArrowColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825

start

:Calcular cutoffInstant = now();

:QueryUserPort\n.findUnverifiedUserIdsBefore(cutoffInstant);
note right
  CQRS — query side.
  Busca usuarios con:
  emailVerified = false
  verificationToken.expiresAt < cutoffInstant
  Devuelve solo List<UserId>.
end note

if (¿lista vacía?) then (sí)
  :retornar — nada que eliminar;
  stop
endif

while (¿quedan IDs en la lista?) is (sí)
  :DeleteUserPort.delete(userId);
  note right
    SRP — puerto dedicado a borrado.
    Separado de SaveUserPort.
  end note
endwhile (no)

stop

@enduml
